			       X = lateral (+ = saga)   Y = hoist hatti (+ = yukari, kuleye dogru)   Z = X^Y
			     0 = mesh dogrudan yoke dugumune oturur (varsayilan). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.BucketTopMeshLocalXM" dynamicAttribute="true">
