			<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
			     DRAG VINCI TIPI: INTERLOCK'LU (2026-08-04; slack modu KAPATILDI)
			     ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
			     ★ 2026-08-04: bu makine INTERLOCK'LU vince (true) alindi = base
			       ~GenericDragline davranisi; halat salmada gergin-yakin kalir
			       (payout tavani DragPayoutSlackM 2.20 + carry-gate, gorsel sag
			       dead-band'i 2.50/6.00 aynen uygulanir). Asagidaki slack modu
			       aciklamasi value="false" icin gecerlidir (canli A/B: dynamicAttribute).

			     2026-07-27 musteri talebi (slack modunun gerekcesi): "drag halati
			     salindiginda halatin gevsemesi, hatta fazla salinirsa yerde
			     surunmesi gerekiyor."

			     ~GenericDragline.entity base'inde DragPayoutInterlockEnabled = true
			     (gucle surulen / interlock'lu vinc = halat daima gergin, 2026-07-09
			     "power lowering" modeli). value="false" -> slack-yetenekli vinc:
			       * payout tavani kalkmaz ama Dragline.Rig.DragSlackMaxM'e (8 m)
			         genisler -> halat gercekten bosalir; drag halati karinlari (R1/R2)
			         + gorsel halat node'lari zemin tabanina oturur = YERDE SURUNUR.
			       * gorsel sag dead-band'i (DragRopeSlackReleaseStart/FullM 2.50/6.00)
			         kod tarafinda fizikle ESLENIR (0.30/3.00) -> fizikte slack varken
			         halatin gergin RENDER edilmesi (eski durum) olmaz.
			       * drag-in'de olu sarma DragSlackTakeUpRateMps (4 m/s, yuksuz tambur)
			         ile kisalir -> "cektim ama kova kimildamiyor" fazi ~1 s.
			     Slack/toplama degerleri base'de (DragSlackMaxM / DragSlackTakeUpRateMps);
			     buradan da override edilebilir. Slack davranisina geri donmek icin bu
			     attribute'u false yap (dynamicAttribute -> egitmen UI'sindan canli A/B). -->
			<!-- * 2026-08-24 (kullanici: ipleri salarken birkac metrede bitiyor, saldikca yere
			     dogru inmeli): interlock 2.20 m DragPayoutSlackM tavani halati birkac metrede
			     kesiyordu. SLACK MODUNA alindi -> payout tavani DragSlackMaxM (asagida 15 m) e
			     genisler, halat gercekten bosalir ve yere yatar. -->
			<!-- * 2026-08-27 GERI ALINDI, INTERLOCK ACIK (true). Kullanici: "normal modda
			     (yani serbest dusme degilken) drag halati gergin kalmali; musteri 08-24
			     yorumunu degistirdi, halatin bosalmasi SADECE serbest dusme acikken olurmus."
			     Bu tam olarak interlock'un tanimi: gucle surulen vinc halati gergin tutar,
			     ama SERBEST DUSME (dragFF) tavandan MUAFTIR (kod: DraglineActuator.cpp,
			     "if (!dragFF && (digCeilActive || payoutCeilActive))" -> FF'te hicbir kirpma
			     yok, halat tamburun birakti kadar bosalir ve yere yatar).
			     Yani: normal salma -> tavan DragPayoutSlackM (2.20, base) + carry-gate
			     (agiz asagi dondukce tavan acilir, doyumda donar = dokme bozulmaz);
			     serbest dusme -> sinirsiz slack, 08-24'teki gorunum aynen korunur.
			     DragSlackMaxM (asagida 20) yalniz slack modunda (interlock=false) kullanilir,
			     bu ayarda ATILDIR; geri donmek istenirse tek attribute yeter.
			     ★ Ayrica OLCULDU (2026-08-27, dinamik rig): gergin drag halati kovanin TEK
			       yaw cipasidir. Halat slack'ken kova yaw'da serbest kalip yavasca kendi
			       etrafinda donuyordu (bkz. Dragline.Dyn.SocketSuspendTanDamp notu). -->
						<!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
			     ★ 2026-09-02 TEKRAR SLACK MODU (interlock KAPALI)
			     ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
			     Kullanici karari (dogrudan alintili): "salma sadece free fall modda
			     olmayacak, biz saldigimiz surece salacak ve geri toplama yok."
			     Bu, yukaridaki 08-27 gerekcesini (52ee2b0, aydin.okutanoglu: "bosalma
			     SADECE serbest dusme acikken olur") BILEREK gecersiz kilar; karar
			     sahibine teyit edildi. Kayit zinciri: 07-29 false / 08-04 true /
			     08-24 false / 08-30 true / 09-02 false (bu).
			     Sonuc: normal (FF olmayan) salmada tavan DragPayoutSlackM (2.20) yerine
			     DragSlackMaxM (asagida 20 m) olur ve tek yonlu cirir latch'i sayesinde
			     salma sirasinda ASLA iceri sarmaz; pratik sinir artik tamburun halat
			     boyudur (Dragline.DragRopeLenMaxM 35). Halat gercekten bosalir, gorsel
			     sag dead-band'i kod tarafinda fizikle eslenir, karinlar zemine yatar.
			     GERI TOPLAMA: slack modunda dig tavani zaten yalniz drag-IN'de
			     (dragCmd > 0.05) koser, yani eller bostayken komutsuz sarma YOKTUR;
			     ayrica bugun DragHandsOffTrimEnabled=false ve Dyn.DragRecoverRateMps=0
			     yapildi (asagida). Olu slack drag cekilince DragSlackTakeUpRateMps
			     (4 m/s) ile toplanir.
			     ⚠ IZLENECEK YAN ETKI (08-27 olcumu): gergin drag halati bu makinede
			       kovanin TEK yaw cipasidir; halat slack'ken kova yaw'da serbest kalip
			       yavasca kendi etrafinda donebilir. Gorulurse Dragline.Dyn.BucketYawDampNmS
			       / SocketSuspendTanDamp yukseltilir (halati tekrar germek DEGIL). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.DragPayoutInterlockEnabled" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="false"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- * SLACK TAVANI (2026-08-24): base 8.0 -> 15.0. Zemin ~8 m den uzaktaysa kova/socket
			     ucundaki halatin zemine yatmasi icin ek gevseklik gerekir. dynamicAttribute -> egitmen
			     UI sindan canli tune: daha cok surunme istenirse buyut, kontrollu istenirse kucult.
			     Not: buyudukce drag-in de olu-slack toplama fazi uzar (DragSlackTakeUpRateMps 4 m/s;
			     15 m ~3.75 s); cok uzun gelirse o hizi da yukseltilebilir. -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.DragSlackMaxM" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="20.0"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
			     ★ ELLER-BOSTA TRIM KAPALI (2026-09-02)
			     ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
			     Kullanici: "drag rope'u bazen full salabiliyorum ama bazen salmama izin
			     vermiyor ve saldiktan sonra KENDI KENDINE ipi cekiyor."
			     Ikinci semptomun (komutsuz cekis) kaynagi interlock dig tavaninin
			     `(grounded && restSettled)` terimidir: operator kola dokunmuyorken bile
			     halati lipFair + DragSlackMarginM (0.75) seviyesine mDragRopeRate (4 m/s)
			     ile geri sarar. Ayni terim SERBEST DUSME CIKISINDA da vurur; dragFF
			     yalniz ARMED'de true oldugu icin kol notre donup POWERED_HOLD'a gecildigi
			     tick'te FF muafiyeti kalkar ve FF'te salinan 10-20 m halat komutsuz
			     toplanir (rejim-kirilmasi).
			     false -> trim YALNIZ operator komutuyla kosar. Kaybedilen tek sey
			     "eller bostayken on-toplama"dir; drag-IN dali (4 m/s olu-slack toplama +
			     over-reel floor) AYNEN durdugu icin kazi tepkiselligi operator drag
			     cekmeye basladigi an geri gelir.
			     Semptom geri gelirse ilk bakilacak yer bu attribute (dynamicAttribute ->
			     egitmen UI'sindan canli A/B; true = 2026-09-02 oncesi davranis). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.DragHandsOffTrimEnabled" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="false"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- ★ 2026-09-02: kova YERDEYKEN hoist halati da gercekten bosalsin.
			     Kullanici: "diger halatin da salmasi kisitlanmis, saldikca kendini
			     birakamiyor" (drag tarafinda ayni gun slack moduna gecildi, bkz.
			     DragPayoutInterlockEnabled). Base'teki Dyn.HoistSlackCapM = 0.03 m
			     her rejimde gecerli oldugu icin hoist salmak yerde bile halati
			     gevsetemiyordu. Bu deger yalniz kova YERDE iken devreye girer;
			     havada gucle-indirme (0.03) ve serbest dusme (1.5) tavanlari AYNEN
			     kalir; havada slack halat = yukun birakilmasi = FF rejimi.
			     8.0 = HS825 full-salma icin yoke/kepce_ust_2 parcasi yere dogru
			     daha fazla cokebilsin diye genisletildi. Daha cok yigilma istenirse
			     buyut (dynamicAttribute, canli); zincir/spreader kovanin uzerine
			     dagilirsa kucult. -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Dyn.HoistSlackCapGroundedM" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="8.0"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
			     ★ FF SONRASI DRAG TOPARLAMA KAPALI (2026-09-02)
			     ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
			     Komutsuz cekisin IKINCI yolu: base'deki 2026-08-29i mekanizmasi
			     (Dragline.Dyn.DragRecoverRateMps 0.6 m/s) kova HAVADA + drag kolu bosta
			     iken komut boyunu fiili acikliga (+ zincir + Margin) dogru KISALTIR.
			     Adi "FF sonrasi" olsa da hicbir FF kapisi yoktur: her normal salmadan
			     sonra kol birakildigi anda da kosar -> operator saldigi halati geri
			     alinmis gorur. 0 = mekanizma KAPALI (base yorumundaki A/B kolu).
			     ★ TAKAS (base 08-29i olcumu): serbest dusme sonrasi socket kendi aski
			       halatinin tavaninda (sockYokeM ~5.09 / sockSuspMaxM 5.0) arkada-altta
			       kalabilir ve gergin drag bu makinede TEK yaw cipasi oldugu icin kova
			       yavasca kendi etrafinda donebilir. Bu gozlenirse tam kapatmak yerine
			       kucuk bir hiz + genis marj denenmeli (orn. Rate 0.2 / Margin 1.5):
			       toparlama olur ama operatorun sardigi halati yutmaz. -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Dyn.DragRecoverRateMps" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.0"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
			     ★ K4c (2026-08-17) FAIRLEAD DIKEY KILAVUZ MAKARALARI — GORSEL DONUS
			     ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
			     Kullanici: "makara_dik_sag/sol, ucundaki halati cekip salmamla SENKRON donsun;
			     halati cekerken ice, disa ittirirken disa." Bu tamamen GORSELDIR: fizik
			     (WinchModel/RiggingSolver/mDragRopeLen) DEGISMEZ, yalniz iki mesh doner.
			     Kaynak sinyal = RENDER edilen halatin fairlead'den gecen boyu (mDragHeldLen);
			     yani ekranda halat uzuyorsa makara disa, kisaliyorsa ice doner (bir tick bile
			     ayrisma olmaz). Aci = ∫ (halat hizi / makara yaricapi) dt  [yuvarlanma kosulu].
			     Makaralar bom kadraninda (kol_alt_makara instance'i BdSR[2] = BoomBody pozunda)
			     oldugu icin poz bom-yereldir; bom luff ederken makaralar bomla birlikte gider. -->
			<!-- Ana A/B kolu: false = 2026-08-17 oncesi davranis (makaralar SABIT durur). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerEnabled" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="true"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- Makara yaricapi (m). Mesh olcusu: yarim-eksen X 0.0791 / Z 0.0804 => R ~ 0.08
			     (cap 0.16 m; iki makara merkez arasi 0.201 m => aradaki 0.04 m bosluk = drag
			     halatinin gectigi kanal). Aci hizi = halat hizi / R: 1.5 m/s drag-in ~ 3 tur/s.
			     ★ Gorsel olarak COK HIZLI bulunursa fiziksel dogruyu bozmadan yavaslatmanin
			     yolu bu knob'u BUYUTMEKTIR (R buyudukce aci hizi duser). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerRadiusM" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.079"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
            <!-- halat.simig (boom-hoist halati) POZ + SCALE. DraglineActuator her tick YAZAR
                 (updateBoomHoistRopeVisual): poz DAIMA alt makara (SABIT), donus iki makara
                 arasindaki yone bakar, Z-scale mesafeyi kapatir. Asagidaki degerler yalnizca
                 ilk tick'ten onceki gorunumdur = rest hali (pitch 27.126 = atan2(2.77385,
                 5.41325); iki makara master koordinatlarindan). -->
            <attribute-nvp name="Dragline.BoomHoistRopePose">
                <attribute xsi:type="attr:Mat44Attribute">
                    <attr:pose xsi:type="sim:Pose">
                        <sim:rotation x="0" y="27.126" z="0"/>
                        <sim:position x="0.11520" y="5.63537" z="-3.02143"/>
                    </attr:pose>
                </attribute>
            </attribute-nvp>
            <attribute-nvp name="Dragline.BoomHoistRopeScale">
                <attribute xsi:type="attr:Vec3Attribute">
                    <attr:vec3 x="1" y="1" z="1"/>
                </attribute>
            </attribute-nvp>
            <!-- halat.fbx'in KENDI dogal boyu (yerel +Z, m). Mesh bbox: center z 3.0408 /
                 half 3.0425 => z 0 .. 6.0833, pivot alt uctadir. Z-scale = gercek makara-arasi
                 mesafe / bu deger; yani bu knob DOGRU olursa halatin ucu tam ust makaraya oturur.
                 Halat kisa/uzun gorunuyorsa BU DEGERI oynat (yeniden derleme YOK). -->
            <attribute-nvp name="Dragline.BoomHoistRopeMeshLengthM" dynamicAttribute="true">
                <attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="6.0833"/>
            </attribute-nvp>
            <!-- Mesh pivotunun (z=0 ucu) hangi makarada oldugu. Olculen halat.fbx'te ALT
                 makaradadir -> false. Halat ters yone (bomdan asagi/geriye) bakiyorsa true yap:
                 ankraj ust makaraya gecer, yon alt makaraya doner. -->
            <attribute-nvp name="Dragline.BoomHoistRopeAnchorAtUpper" dynamicAttribute="true">
                <attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="false"/>
            </attribute-nvp>
			<!-- ★ ARKA GANTRY MAKARALARI POZLARI (makara_ust_arka / makara_alt_arka; MainBody-yerel
			     master offset; PosPYR prefab root'unu REPLACE eder). Konum in-sim ayarlanabilir. -->
			<!-- ★ 2026-09-02: ust makara BOOM cocugu (instance-refid="6") -> deger BOOM-YEREL
			     olmali = master(0.11778/8.40922/2.39182) - BoomBody origin(0.118/1.552/1.386,
			     LiebherrHS825Phy.xml relativePosition; govde_kol cercevesi) = asagidaki.
			     Onceki elle-ayarli deger (-0.019/6.81/0.96) master'dan ~5 cm sapiyordu -> halat
			     bogazi ile makara merkezi ortusmuyordu. -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.RearSheaveUstPosPyr" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:PosPYRPairAttribute">
					<attr:pos x="-0.00022" y="6.85722" z="1.00582"/>
					<attr:pitch-yaw-roll x="0.0" y="0" z="0"/>
				</attribute>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.RearSheaveAltPosPyr" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:PosPYRPairAttribute">
					<attr:pos x="0.11520" y="5.63537" z="-3.02143"/>
					<attr:pitch-yaw-roll x="0.0" y="0" z="0"/>
				</attribute>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- Donus YONU isareti (+1 / -1). Fiziksel yuvarlanma bagintisi koda gomulu, ama
			     IG'nin yaw isaret konvansiyonu (bkz. CLAUDE.md: getYawPitchRoll yaw'i TERS
			     dondurur) burada dogrulanmadi -> in-sim ters gorunuyorsa BU DEGERI -1 YAP
			     (yeniden derleme GEREKMEZ, dynamicAttribute). Sag/sol arasi TERSLIK koddadir,
			     bu isaret ikisini birlikte cevirir. -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerSpinSign" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="1.0"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- Makara POZU + sabit egimi (bom-yerel, derece). DraglineActuator yalniz YAW
			     yazar; pos/pitch/roll BURADAN gelir (modelcinin mesh konumu, kol_alt_makara.fbx
			     olcumu — bkz. Dragline.Rig.FairleadLocal* yorumu: fairlead = bu iki makaranin
			     ORTASI). Karsidan bakista kayik gorunurse yalnizca bu iki blok duzeltilir.
			     ★ 2026-08-17 (2. tur, kullanici: "kol_alt_makara tam oturmuyor, Liebherr_HS825.simig'deki
			       gibi tam otursun"). Iki duzeltme bir arada:
			     1) POZ = makara_dik node'larinin git HEAD'deki TAM transform'u (sag 0.098824 /
			        sol -0.102617, y 0.571493, z 3.173307) ARTI kol_alt_makara.simig'e uygulanan
			        (-0.149441, -0.001456, +0.001105) KAYDIRMA. Kaydirmanin sebebi: kol_alt_makara
			        ile govde_kol AYNI poz'a (BdSR[2]) bagli, iki prefab'in da child ofseti 0 ve IG
			        prefab ROOT pozunu YOKSAYIYOR; sonucta modelcinin Liebherr_HS825.simig'de
			        verdigi relatif ofset (kol_alt_makara -0.03162/1.55029/1.38704 EKSI govde_kol
			        0.117821/1.551746/1.385935) kayboluyordu = tum makara grubu 14.9 cm saga kacik.
			        Makaralar govde grubuyla birlikte gitmeli, o yuzden AYNI delta buraya da girdi.
			     2) EGIM = modelcinin 4.988616 derecesi pitch'e geri konuldu; egim yokken 1 m'lik
			        cubugun uclari z'de +/-0.043 m kaciyor, makara_baslik (rot X 4.9506) hizasindan
			        cikiyordu.
			     ★ Egim TERS yone bakiyorsa pitch isaretini cevir (-4.988616); derleme YOK.
			     ★ 2026-09-02 GUNCEL: "donerken uclar konik cizer (presesyon)" sorunu ARTIK KODDA
			        cozuldu (asagidaki Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerLocalSpin) -> egimi sifirlamaya da,
			        donusu kapatmaya da GEREK YOK; buradaki egim serbestce ayarlanabilir. -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerSagPosPyr" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:PosPYRPairAttribute">
					<attr:pos x="0.099" y="0.571" z="3.173"/>
					<attr:pitch-yaw-roll x="4.989" y="0" z="0"/>
				</attribute>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerSolPosPyr" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:PosPYRPairAttribute">
					<attr:pos x="-0.103" y="0.571" z="3.173"/>
					<attr:pitch-yaw-roll x="4.989" y="0" z="0"/>
				</attribute>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerUstPosPyr" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:PosPYRPairAttribute">
					<attr:pos x="-0.0" y="0.863" z="2.876"/>
					<attr:pitch-yaw-roll x="0.0" y="0" z="0"/>
				</attribute>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerAltPosPyr" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:PosPYRPairAttribute">
					<attr:pos x="-0.0" y="0.303" z="2.823"/>
					<attr:pitch-yaw-roll x="0.0" y="0" z="0"/>
				</attribute>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- ★ 2026-09-02 (kullanici: "makara_dik_sag/sol cekise gore doner ama KENDI LOKALINDE
			     donmuyor, donus yamuk oluyor"). Sebep: PosPYR IG'de FRotator(Pitch,Yaw,Roll) olarak
			     uygulanir, YAW EN DIS eksendir (parent'in dikey ekseni). Yukaridaki 4.989 derecelik
			     montaj egimi sabit dururken yaw degistigi icin egimin YONU de yaw ile birlikte
			     doner = PRESESYON (makara donerken kafa sallar; ~7 mm salinim). Duzeltme
			     DraglineActuator'da: yaw yine spin acisi, ama montaj egimi spin kadar GERI
			     dondurulup yazilir -> dunyada egim SABIT, makara kendi egik ekseninde temiz doner.
			     Egim + poz yine YUKARIDAKI PosPyr'dan gelir (canli degistirilebilir; kod yeni
			     degeri otomatik taban alir). -->
			<!-- A/B kolu: false = eski davranis (yalniz yaw yazilir, presesyon geri gelir). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerLocalSpin" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="true"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- Egim geri-dondurme YONU (+1/-1). In-sim yamukluk azalmak yerine ARTIYORSA -1 yap
			     (derleme YOK). Makara dururken (aci 0) gorunum her iki degerde de aynidir. -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerTiltPhaseSign" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="1.0"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Indicator_Plate" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:PosPYRPairAttribute">
					<attr:pos x="-0.635" y="0.806" z="0.842"/>
					<attr:pitch-yaw-roll x="0.0" y="0" z="0"/>
				</attribute>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Indicator_Dial" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:PosPYRPairAttribute">
					<attr:pos x="-0.635" y="0.806" z="0.842"/>
					<attr:pitch-yaw-roll x="0.0" y="0" z="0"/>
				</attribute>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- ★ 2026-08-24 (kullanici: "Indicator Dial 13253 BoomBody'ye bagli aci olcerin IGNESI
			     boom derecesine gore donsun; boom kalktikca/indikce doner"). Igne (13253) BoomBody
			     cocugudur (instance-refid=6) ve GORSEL doner: DraglineActuator, yukaridaki
			     Dragline.Indicator_Dial PosPyr'ina her tick YALNIZ secilen donus eksenini yazar
			     (pos/taban-egim PosPyr'dan gelir, modelci konumu). Kadran YUZU = Indicator_Plate
			     (13252, sabit). Igne yerel donusu = Offset + Gain * boomAngleDisplay (gercek boom
			     acisi, 0-90). Asagidaki knob'lar egitmen UI'sindan CANLI kalibre edilir (derleme YOK). -->
			<!-- A/B kolu: false = igne SABIT (Indicator_Plate/BoomBody etkilenmez). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.BoomAngleDialEnabled" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="true"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- Igne donus EKSENI: 0 = pitch (varsayilan), 1 = yaw, 2 = roll. Kadran mesh'inin bakis
			     duzlemine gore secilir; in-sim yanlis eksende donuyorsa bu knob'la duzelt (derleme YOK). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.BoomAngleDialSpinAxis" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.0"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- Supurme orani: igne derece / boom derece. NEGATIF yaparsan igne ters yone supurur.
			     ★ 2026-08-24 kalibrasyon (kullanici 2 uc-nokta): boom en altta ham=15 -> hedef -40,
			       boom en ustte ham=80 -> hedef 50. Gain = (50-(-40))/(80-15) = 90/65 = 1.3846. -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.BoomAngleDialGain" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="1.3846"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- Sifir kalibrasyonu (derece): igne = Offset + Gain*boomAngleDisplay.
			     Offset = -40 - 1.3846*15 = -60.77 (yukaridaki 2 uc-noktadan). Uc noktalar kaymissa
			     tek uctan: Offset += (hedef - okunan) yeter (Gain sabit). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.BoomAngleDialOffsetDeg" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="-60.77"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- ★ K4c 3. tur (2026-08-24, kullanici: "makara_alt 13251 + makara_ust 13250 de ipi cekip
			     salmaya gore donsun"). Bunlar YATAY EKSENLI makaralar (dikey istiflenmis; drag halati
			     uzerlerinden gecer) -> dikey makaralarin (dik_sag/sol, yaw) aksine PITCH doner. Ayni
			     drag-halat sinyalinden (mDragHeldLen) surulur; ust/alt sag/sol gibi TERS isaretlidir
			     (halata bakan iki yuz ayni yone yuvarlansin). POZ/EGIM yukaridaki Ust/Alt PosPyr'dan
			     gelir, burada YALNIZ secilen eksen (varsayilan pitch) yazilir. -->
			<!-- Yatay makara alt-A/B kolu: false = alt/ust SABIT durur (dik_sag/sol etkilenmez). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerHorizEnabled" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="true"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- Donus YONU (+1/-1). Sag/sol'daki gibi: in-sim ters gorunuyorsa -1 yap (derleme YOK). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerHorizSpinSign" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="1.0"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- Donus EKSENI: 0 = pitch (varsayilan, yatay eksenli makara), 1 = yaw, 2 = roll.
			     Mesh'in gercek mil ekseni farkliysa in-sim bu knob'la duzeltilir (derleme YOK). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.Rig.FairleadRollerHorizSpinAxis" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.0"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- ★ Boom (cendere) kalkis/inis hizini motor devrine (RPM) gore olcekle:
			     dusuk devir = yavas bom, tam gaz = tam hiz. Rolantide bile MinFrac
			     kadar hareket kalir. Canli ayarlanabilir (dynamicAttribute). -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.BoomRpmScaleEnabled" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="true"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- Kalibrasyon: full RPM (2100) 10 derece / 10 sn = 1.0 derece/sn; rolanti
			     (~800, minIdle 920 altinda -> rpmFrac=0 -> olcek=MinFrac) 40 derece /
			     3:40 (220 sn) = 0.182 derece/sn. Oran = 0.182/1.0 = 0.18. -->
			<attribute-nvp name="Dragline.BoomRpmScaleMinFrac" dynamicAttribute="true">
				<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.18"/>
			</attribute-nvp>
			<!-- ★ Dinamik rig doguş + hoist halati ayarlari BASE'DE
			     (~GenericDragline.entity): HoistBirthMode / HoistBirthSnapMaxM /
			     HoistRopeSpringStiffness / HoistRopeSpringDamping. Kullanici karari
			     2026-08-28: bu knob'lar araca ozel degil, tum dragline'lar icin
			     gecerli oldugu icin base'de yasar. Buraya override KOYMA. -->
		</initial-state-repository>
		<components>
			<controller componentClass="ModelHeavyIndustry.RemoteUtilController" componentName="RemoteUtilController"/>
			<controller componentClass="ModelHeavyIndustry.InputController" componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController">
				<component-state-repository>
					<!-- Motor devri (el gazi salteri) davranisi. Init-time okunur. -->
					<!-- Arttir/azalt rampa hizi (oran/sn): 0.25 => rolantiden tam devire ~4 sn. -->
					<attribute-nvp name="RpmAdjustRatePerSec">
						<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.25"/>
					</attribute-nvp>
					<!-- Bekleme (dwell) sonrasi rolantiye sonme hizi (oran/sn): 0.10 => ~10 sn. -->
					<attribute-nvp name="RpmDecayRatePerSec">
						<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.10"/>
					</attribute-nvp>
					<!-- Salter notre dondukten sonra devir kac sn bulundugu seviyede TUTULACAK. -->
					<attribute-nvp name="RpmHoldDwellSec">
						<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="7.5"/>
					</attribute-nvp>
					<!-- Rolantiye SONME ozelligini AC (opt-in; kod varsayilani false). Gercek
					     HS825'te devir arttir/azalt salteri momentary'dir: birakilinca devir
					     dwell suresi sonunda rolantiye suzulur, sabitleyici (60127) ile tutulur.
					     Dozer/ekskavator gibi EL GAZI MUTLAK olan araclarda bu attr YOKTUR
					     (false) -> devir operatorun biraktigi yerde kalir. -->
					<attribute-nvp name="RpmDecayEnabled">
						<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="true"/>
					</attribute-nvp>
				</component-state-repository>
			</controller>
			<controller componentClass="SimFrameworkExtensions.IO.EntityIOController" componentName="EntityIOController"/>
			<controller componentClass="ModelHeavyIndustry.BulldozerEngineController" componentName="EngineController">
				<component-state-repository>
				</component-state-repository>
			</controller>
			<!-- Litronic Servis Paneli dashboard controller: ekran navigasyonu (one-hot
			     DisplayScreenStates), sag konsol LED'leri ve uyari lambalarini GERCEK sim
			     durumundan besler. Plugin'de zaten kayitli; bu satir entity'ye baglar. -->
			<controller componentClass="ModelHeavyIndustry.Dragline.LiebherrHS825DashboardController" componentName="DashboardController"/>
			<controller componentClass="ModelHeavyIndustry.VisualEffectController" componentName="VisualEffectController">
				<component-state-repository>
					<attribute-nvp name="IsExhaustSmokeActive">
						<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="true"/>
					</attribute-nvp>
					<attribute-nvp name="IsDustEffectActive">
						<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="true"/>
					</attribute-nvp>
					<attribute-nvp name="IsForwardBackwardPitchingActive">
						<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="true"/>
					</attribute-nvp>
					<attribute-nvp name="IsShakeActive">
						<attribute xsi:type="attr:BoolAttribute" value="true"/>
					</attribute-nvp>
				</component-state-repository>
			</controller>
			<!-- Faz 1 MT-temizlik: MainBody/BoomBody BodyVehicleActuator'lari KALDIRILDI.
			     BodyVehicleActuator raw setRigidBodyFlag(eKINEMATIC) + lockWrite setGlobalPose
			     yapiyordu -> deformable terrain raycast'leriyle PhysX concurrent-write race.
			     Yerine: KinematicTankActuator MainBody/BoomBody govdelerini kinematik part
			     olarak yukler; DraglineActuator (Dragline/Actuator/DraglineActuator) her tick
			     bunlari KinematicPart::apply() -> PhyDelayedExec ile sasiya gore surer
			     (BdSR[1]/BdSR[2] -> SimIGConf binding'i degismeden). Raw PhysX YOK. -->
			<!-- Faz 1 palet kinematik swap: eski PxVehicle-bagimli TrackActuator yerine
			     dozer'in kanitli kinematik paleti. KinematicTrackActuator, KinematicTankActuator'in
			     yayinladigi wheel-ground SR'larini (KinematicTankActuator.WheelGroundLeft/Right{i})
			     okur ve shoe gorsellerini SimMsgCreateVisualModel ile self-spawn eder. Hiz =
			     KinematicTankActuator.mLeft/RightTrackLinearSpeedOutPort (fiziksel m/s). -->
			<actuator componentClass="ModelHeavyIndustry.KinematicTrackActuator" componentName="KinematicTrackActuator"/>
			<!-- Faz 0 (dragline kinematik yeniden tasarim): eski LiebherrHS825Actuator
			     bu YENI entity'ye KONULMADI. no-op DraglineActuator, ~GenericDragline
			     base'inden (super-type 0:1:1:-1:111:334:2:-1) miras alinir. Eski
			     LiebherrHS825.entity DOKUNULMADAN eski actuator ile calismaya devam eder. -->
			<!-- Generic radio for receiving terrain-deformation resistance from
			     PhyDeformableTerrainEntity. channelID=2 matches the channel the
			     terrain uses to broadcast SimMsgExcavatorPhysicalInteractionRadioInfo.
			     LiebherrHS825Actuator looks this up via findRadio() in init().
			     Placed between actuators and replace-components per the XSD
			     ordering (sensors → controllers → actuators → radios → replacements). -->
			<radio radioClass="SimFrameworkExtensions.GenericEntityCommRadio" channelID="2" />
			<replace-component oldComponent="FourWheelVehicleActuator">
				<!-- Faz 1 MT-temizlik: PhysX PxVehicle (AdvancedVehicle.TankVehicleActuator)
				     yerine dozer'in kanitli kinematik sasisi. PxVehicle her tick raw
				     raycast + setGlobalPose/setRigidBodyFlag yapiyordu -> deformable
				     terrain ile concurrent-write race. KinematicTankActuator tum PhysX
				     yazimlarini PhyDelayedExec ile yapar (MT-guvenli) ve Phy.xml govdelerini
				     (myBody + MainBody + BoomBody) kinematik part olarak yukler. -->
				<newComponent componentClass="ModelHeavyIndustry.KinematicTankActuator">
					<component-state-repository>
						<attribute-nvp name="optimalWheelPressurePSI">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="33"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="wheelPressureToRadiusChangeMultiplier">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.004"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="SteeringSpringForceFromForce">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.3"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="SteeringSpringForceFromSpeed">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.7"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
					</component-state-repository>
				</newComponent>
			</replace-component>
			<replace-component oldComponent="VehicleMiscAudioActuator">
				<newComponent componentClass="ModelHeavyIndustry.BulldozerAudioActuator" componentName="BulldozerAudioActuator">
					<component-state-repository>
						<attribute-nvp name="reverseMovement" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="HyundaiAccentParkSensor" value="0.1"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="audioWarning" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="P754DOZER_Buzzer" value="0.2"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="soilInteraction" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="P754DOZER_SOIL_INTERACTION_ENGINE" value="1.0"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="bladeDrop" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="P754DOZER_BicakCarpma" value="1.0"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="signalCoefficient" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="1.0"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="signal" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:StringAttribute" value="ConectoSignalSound"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="horn" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:StringAttribute" value="P754DOZER_Korna"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="wiperCoefficient" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="1.0"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="wiper" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:StringAttribute" value="GenericWiper"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="PalletSoundMapping" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:VectorAttribute">
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="HMK300LC_PalletGevsek" value="0.25"/>
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="HMK300LC_PalletNormal" value="0.25"/>
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="HMK300LC_PalletGergin" value="0.25"/>
							</attribute>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="PalletSoundPitchMapping" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:VectorAttribute">
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="0" value="0.4"/>
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="11" value="1.6"/>
							</attribute>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="WalkingOnMetalSound" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="HMK300LC_MetalRattle2" value="0.2"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="SpinOnMetalSound" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="HMK300LC_MetalSqueak" value="0.0"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="MetalHitSound" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="HMK300LC_MetalHit" value="1.0"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="accidentCoefficient" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.0"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="accident" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:StringAttribute" value="GenericCrash"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="RPMToSoundMapping" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:VectorAttribute">
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="850" value="P754DOZER_RPMSET_2_0920"/>
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="950" value="P754DOZER_RPMSET_2_0970"/>
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="1150" value="P754DOZER_RPMSET_2_1100"/>
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="1250" value="P754DOZER_RPMSET_2_1230"/>
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="1350" value="P754DOZER_RPMSET_2_1400"/>
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="1500" value="P754DOZER_RPMSET_2_1500"/>
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="1680" value="P754DOZER_RPMSET_2_1680"/>
								<attr:item xsi:type="attr:NVPAttribute" name="1720" value="P754DOZER_RPMSET_2_1720"/>
							</attribute>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="engineStartCoefficient" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="1.0"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="engineStopCoefficient" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="1.0"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="engineRPMCoefficient" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="0.8"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="engineStart" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:StringAttribute" value="ConectoEngineStart"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="engineStop" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:StringAttribute" value="ConectoEngineStop"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="engineStartStopSoundRPM" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:FloatAttribute" value="100"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
						<attribute-nvp name="gainAverageCount" dynamicAttribute="true">
							<attribute xsi:type="attr:IntAttribute" value="50"/>
						</attribute-nvp>
					</component-state-repository>
				</newComponent>
			</replace-component>
			<remove-component>VehicleEngineAudioActuator</remove-component>
			<!-- Dragline temizligi: silecek + dozer-turevli karayolu kural denetleyici kaldirildi.
			     Wiper: WiperActuator->WiperAdvancedActuator replace yerine inherited WiperActuator silindi (baglanti yok).
			     RuleChecker: PhyAdvancedVehicleRuleCheckerController->BulldozerRuleCheckerController replace yerine
			     inherited base silindi + 13 input connection (sink) cikarildi -> log spam yok. -->
			<remove-component>AdvancedVehicle.PhyAdvancedVehicleRuleCheckerController</remove-component>
			<remove-component>WiperActuator</remove-component>
		</components>
		<connections>
			<!-- BulldozerAudioActuator -->
			<connection>
				<fromSR attribute="IO.StarterKey"/>
				<to componentClass="BulldozerAudioActuator" port="mStarterKeyPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentClass="FourWheelVehicleActuator" port="mVirtualStarterKeyOutPort"/>
				<to componentClass="BulldozerAudioActuator" port="mVirtualStarterKeyInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="EngineController" port="mLeftSpeedOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerAudioActuator" port="mLeftPalletSpeedInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="EngineController" port="mRightSpeedOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerAudioActuator" port="mRightPalletSpeedInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="EngineController" port="mReverseMovementSoundOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerAudioActuator" port="mReverseMovementSoundInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="EngineController" port="mAudioWarningSoundOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerAudioActuator" port="mAudioWarningSoundInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="EngineController" port="mSoilInteractionSoundOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerAudioActuator" port="mSoilInteractionSoundInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="BulldozerJointActuator" port="mIsBladeHitSoundStateOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerAudioActuator" port="mBladeDropSoundInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="BulldozerJointActuator" port="mIsInContactWithMetalOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerAudioActuator" port="mWalkingOnMetalSoundInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="EngineController" port="mSlipValueOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerAudioActuator" port="mIsSpinningInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<!--HeavyIndustryInputController-->
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mStarterKeyOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="EngineController" port="mStarterKeyInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mSafetySwitchOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="EngineController" port="mSafetyArmInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mSpeedUpOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="EngineController" port="mSpeedUpInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mSpeedDownOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="EngineController" port="mSpeedDownInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<!-- AYRI TRAVEL PALET PEDALLARI (work-mode KALDIRILDI): travel = ayri sol/sag palet pedallari (60110/60111), drag/hoist = J1 (her zaman). DraglineActuator pedal degerlerini KinematicTankActuator'in independent-pedal in-port'larina yazar (EngineController.mMoveJoystick* baglantilari KALDIRILDI; maxSpeed/RPM yine motordan gelir). -->
			<connection>
				<from componentName="DraglineActuator" port="mLeftTrackPedalOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="ModelHeavyIndustry.KinematicTankActuator" port="mLeftTrackPedalInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="DraglineActuator" port="mRightTrackPedalOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="ModelHeavyIndustry.KinematicTankActuator" port="mRightTrackPedalInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mJoystick1Vertical"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerJointActuator" port="mMoveJoystickForwardBackwardInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mWalkingModeOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="EngineController" port="mWalkingModeInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mBreakOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="EngineController" port="mBreakInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<!-- EMNIYET KOLU (Kilavuz 4.6.2, "isletmeyi serbest birakma kolu").
			     5007 (GUI slot 1 / SimNet slot 40) -> mSafetySwitchOutPort; true = kol
			     YUKARI = kumandalar bloke. DraglineActuator kilidi TEK NOKTADAN uygular
			     (slew/boom/drag/hoist/palet pedallari + FF onsecimi + slew freewheel);
			     KinematicTankActuator ayrica palet hedef hizini sifirlar.
			     NOT: eski "BulldozerJointActuator" hedefi bu entity'de TANIMSIZ bir
			     bilesendi (yalniz PR736/754/756 dozerlerinde var) -> kilit hicbir zaman
			     is ekipmanina ulasmiyordu. DraglineActuator ile degistirildi. -->
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mSafetySwitchOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="DraglineActuator" port="mSafetyLeverActiveInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mSafetySwitchOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="ModelHeavyIndustry.KinematicTankActuator" port="mSafetyLeverActiveInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mSafetySwitchOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerAudioActuator" port="mSafetyLeverActiveInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<!-- (J1->EngineController duplicate baglantilari kaldirildi; DraglineActuator multiplex devrede) -->
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mTargetEngineRPMOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="EngineController" port="mTargetEngineRPMInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mInfoButtonOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="EngineController" port="mInfoButtonInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mJoystick2Horizontal"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerJointActuator" port="mHamutBladeInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mJoystick2Vertical"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerJointActuator" port="mHamutInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mJoystick3Horizontal"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerJointActuator" port="mRiperAltTabanAndVehicleInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mJoystick3Vertical"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerJointActuator" port="mRiperAltTabanAndRiperInport"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mFloatButtonOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerJointActuator" port="mFloatButtonInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mJoystick1Vertical"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerJointActuator" port="mThrottleForwardInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mJoystick1Horizontal"/>
				<to componentName="BulldozerJointActuator" port="mThrottleLeftRightInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mFloatButtonOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="EngineController" port="mFloatButtonInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mEmergencyButtonOutPort"/>
				<to componentName="EngineController" port="mEmergencyButtonInPort"/>
			</connection>
			<connection>
				<from componentName="HeavyIndustryInputController" port="mTowingButtonOutPort"/>
